WEBVTT

00:10.870 --> 00:14.430
Hey, did something just bang the door?

00:14.430 --> 00:15.670
You're right.

00:18.000 --> 00:19.840
Hey, what happened?

00:28.410 --> 00:29.510
What?!

00:31.040 --> 00:33.430
Demons?!

00:34.350 --> 00:37.080
What are they doing here?!

00:40.940 --> 00:41.670
Wha...

00:41.670 --> 00:43.860
Enchant Physical Ability.

00:44.180 --> 00:45.270
Go.

00:55.000 --> 00:55.970
Come on.

00:57.240 --> 00:58.660
Lady Flora, this way.

00:58.660 --> 01:00.350
These monsters...

01:02.380 --> 01:03.980
Hmph. Go.

01:14.070 --> 01:14.640
Damn.

01:15.660 --> 01:16.560
Take this!

01:27.930 --> 01:30.110
Gosh...

01:34.980 --> 01:36.990
Come forth, Yamata-no-orochi.

01:46.190 --> 01:47.200
Move.

02:21.000 --> 02:23.540
SEIREI GENSOUKI - SPIRIT CHRONICLES SEASON 2

03:23.820 --> 03:25.100
Roanna, get down!

03:30.110 --> 03:31.430
I'll kill you!

03:42.240 --> 03:43.740
Master Hiroaki!

03:45.490 --> 03:51.090
I've always wanted to punch him
right in the face...

03:51.500 --> 03:54.090
It's speaking...

03:54.840 --> 03:57.090
You're next.

03:57.450 --> 03:59.730
Don't think you'll be having
an easy death.

04:02.870 --> 04:05.480
Lady Flora, stay behind me!

04:06.910 --> 04:07.890
How dare you!

04:19.780 --> 04:20.890
Father!

04:21.330 --> 04:23.740
You're in my way!
Let go!

04:23.740 --> 04:25.630
Duke Huguenot!

04:29.420 --> 04:32.420
That's all you've got?

04:32.420 --> 04:34.120
You...!

04:34.640 --> 04:35.880
Father!

04:46.490 --> 04:49.020
Lady Flora, run away while you can.

04:49.020 --> 04:52.380
Huh? But... what about you?

04:52.380 --> 04:55.080
I'll be a distraction to buy you time.

04:55.080 --> 04:57.800
Get to the corridor while
I draw their attention.

04:57.800 --> 05:00.360
But I can't!

05:00.360 --> 05:01.610
Please.

05:01.970 --> 05:04.220
At this rate, we...

05:04.930 --> 05:06.100
...will all be wiped out.

05:15.660 --> 05:18.760
You monster!

05:40.480 --> 05:41.530
Hurry.

05:51.600 --> 05:54.700
Lady Flora? Are you there?

06:00.420 --> 06:03.760
Here's Lady Flora!
Take her out of here!

06:06.470 --> 06:08.680
Roanna! You should run away too!

06:09.030 --> 06:10.140
Roanna!

06:12.390 --> 06:13.980
Photon Bullet!

06:14.930 --> 06:16.150
Lady Flora.

06:16.560 --> 06:18.400
Come with me.

06:18.720 --> 06:19.810
Wait!

06:20.420 --> 06:21.820
Let go!

06:21.820 --> 06:23.580
Come on now.

06:23.580 --> 06:25.780
No!

06:32.540 --> 06:34.540
Don't stop!

06:34.960 --> 06:37.130
Get to the inside!

06:40.300 --> 06:41.260
Haruto.

06:43.180 --> 06:46.000
I sense demons up there.

06:46.000 --> 06:46.750
Huh?

06:47.530 --> 06:48.760
Master Haruto!

06:50.130 --> 06:53.980
Lady Cecilia and Lady Aishia too...
I'm glad you're safe.

06:53.980 --> 06:55.800
Yes, barely.

06:55.800 --> 06:59.720
I heard you stopped
the attack in the east gate.

06:59.720 --> 07:02.210
Thank you very much.

07:02.210 --> 07:07.240
Not at all. The guards and attendants
also lent me their strength.

07:07.800 --> 07:10.120
You two must be tired.

07:10.120 --> 07:12.640
I'll take you to a safe place.

07:12.640 --> 07:14.110
Before that...

07:15.060 --> 07:17.550
Have some demons
infiltrated this place?

07:20.140 --> 07:23.250
No... We haven't heard anything...

07:23.250 --> 07:26.010
...from the patrolling guards...

07:26.380 --> 07:27.730
I see.

07:27.730 --> 07:30.450
Is there something on your mind?

07:30.450 --> 07:31.530
Actually...

07:31.930 --> 07:35.740
We can sense a peculiar
presence over there.

07:37.730 --> 07:42.040
That's where the Hero and Lady Flora
are taking shelter.

07:42.040 --> 07:44.130
It should be safe...

07:44.130 --> 07:47.000
I'll contact the guards
to check up on them just in case.

07:47.850 --> 07:51.110
Hey, let me go!
Please!

07:51.110 --> 07:52.810
We must call for help!

07:54.300 --> 07:57.710
The ones inside are
strengthened revenants.

07:58.050 --> 08:01.100
It'll be too late
by the time backup arrives.

08:01.100 --> 08:03.400
You...

08:03.400 --> 08:04.460
Who are you...

08:05.550 --> 08:06.520
Well...

08:08.220 --> 08:10.720
I'm just human scum.

08:11.610 --> 08:14.590
So you're after me?

08:14.590 --> 08:18.430
Yes, but it'll be boring
to just go back like this.

08:19.180 --> 08:20.230
Let's see...

08:20.600 --> 08:23.720
That girl who handed you to me...

08:23.720 --> 08:27.490
If she knows that you're kidnapped
because of her...

08:27.490 --> 08:30.580
I wonder how she'll look like.

08:30.580 --> 08:33.670
It's interesting just imagining it.

08:34.740 --> 08:37.000
Yes, that look...

08:38.100 --> 08:39.970
Very fine indeed...

08:40.930 --> 08:42.210
Let go!

08:42.210 --> 08:44.550
Good grief...

08:44.550 --> 08:45.510
Yo.

08:45.510 --> 08:49.220
Stop dawdling and get a move on already.

08:49.220 --> 08:53.190
The humanoid spirit
has entered the manor.

08:53.190 --> 08:55.610
We cannot confront that.

08:55.610 --> 08:58.130
Oh, all right.

09:00.930 --> 09:04.820
If you don't want me to
cut off your beautiful legs...

09:06.330 --> 09:07.920
You better not move too much.

09:11.670 --> 09:16.040
He's always so quick to be hedonistic
whenever he gets excited.

09:16.040 --> 09:19.280
He's more like a beast than a human.

09:23.810 --> 09:25.200
Photon Bullet!

09:26.420 --> 09:28.090
I'm not done yet.

09:38.250 --> 09:39.560
Photon Bullet!

09:41.070 --> 09:44.270
Ah? Did something just hit me?

09:45.280 --> 09:46.690
Photon Bullet!

09:48.520 --> 09:52.250
I didn't do any damage?!
How hard is that thing?!

10:11.360 --> 10:13.430
Now I'm pissed...

10:13.430 --> 10:15.150
I'm super pissed...

10:15.610 --> 10:16.930
Master Hiroaki!

10:17.490 --> 10:20.270
How dare you use dirty tricks!

10:20.680 --> 10:25.940
You're surprisingly sturdy.
I hit you at full strength, though.

10:26.330 --> 10:29.110
You cockroaches...

10:29.110 --> 10:30.400
Drop dead!

10:34.090 --> 10:35.510
You really are crap.

10:36.070 --> 10:37.910
You piss me off!

10:38.210 --> 10:39.190
What the...

10:39.720 --> 10:40.910
How...

10:41.270 --> 10:43.160
You're next, asshole!

10:54.630 --> 10:56.090
Roanna, get down!

11:15.300 --> 11:16.780
I'll kill you!

11:19.260 --> 11:20.200
Drop dead!

11:28.750 --> 11:31.960
SEIREI GENSOUKI - SPIRIT CHRONICLES SEASON 2

11:35.260 --> 11:37.610
All right, this way, please.

11:37.610 --> 11:38.510
Okay.

11:47.040 --> 11:48.230
What the?!

11:48.230 --> 11:49.480
That room...

11:49.850 --> 11:52.250
It's where the Hero and the others are!

12:11.180 --> 12:12.470
Hold it!

12:13.510 --> 12:15.230
That's it.

12:16.310 --> 12:17.970
This is just a preventive measure,

12:17.970 --> 12:22.110
but we can't have you awaken
to your hero power here.

12:22.470 --> 12:24.470
Y-You...

12:24.470 --> 12:26.980
You go outside.

12:27.320 --> 12:30.140
There should be
an interesting game out there.

12:30.140 --> 12:32.050
O-Okay.

12:33.660 --> 12:37.200
He tends to play around
when he gets excited...

12:37.200 --> 12:41.970
He really is still far from perfect.
A defect, I suppose.

13:13.300 --> 13:14.770
Hold them off!

13:15.940 --> 13:17.040
Hooah!

13:36.440 --> 13:37.880
Let go!

13:41.210 --> 13:42.670
Princess Flora!

13:50.390 --> 13:51.550
Lady Flora!

13:55.910 --> 13:58.690
I'll be taking the princess!

13:59.190 --> 14:03.070
Um, Roanna and the Hero are up there!

14:03.070 --> 14:04.810
Somebody!

14:04.810 --> 14:06.580
I'll cut your legs.

14:11.650 --> 14:12.740
That voice...

14:28.810 --> 14:30.950
Get that man!

14:30.950 --> 14:31.910
Yes!

14:54.520 --> 14:55.810
Stay back.

14:56.790 --> 14:59.500
Aren't there more of them now?

15:05.180 --> 15:06.190
Huh?

15:17.630 --> 15:19.110
Everyone...

15:20.990 --> 15:23.110
Leave those monsters to us.

15:23.430 --> 15:25.580
Protect the citizens...

15:29.060 --> 15:30.720
Lady Flora...

15:36.970 --> 15:38.720
Haruto, go.

15:39.680 --> 15:41.140
You're worried about her, right?

15:41.980 --> 15:44.250
I'll leave Lady Flora to you.

15:44.250 --> 15:45.350
But...

15:46.220 --> 15:47.700
Right now...

15:48.630 --> 15:51.140
You have a very
sad look on your face.

15:52.860 --> 15:55.690
Prioritise your feelings now.

15:55.690 --> 15:57.540
I'll be fine.

15:57.540 --> 16:00.270
It's my turn to help you now.

16:03.980 --> 16:05.250
Earth Prison!

16:16.540 --> 16:17.990
I told you, right?

16:18.370 --> 16:20.580
I can stand my ground and fight.

16:21.450 --> 16:23.120
Thank you.

16:24.420 --> 16:27.400
Aishia, I'll leave the rest to you.

16:27.400 --> 16:28.550
You can count on me.

16:29.340 --> 16:31.000
Lady Liselotte.

16:31.630 --> 16:34.460
You have my word that
I'll save Princess Flora.

16:34.460 --> 16:35.990
Please do.

16:46.930 --> 16:49.010
What was that?

16:49.010 --> 16:52.350
Cecilia, deploy a magic barrier,

16:52.350 --> 16:55.130
and protect yourself and the lady.

16:55.620 --> 16:56.930
Okay.

16:56.930 --> 16:59.750
I'll go trim their number down.

17:03.720 --> 17:06.690
Duodectet Magician, Magic Barrier!

17:21.870 --> 17:24.560
The surroundings are
all covered in a dome...

17:24.560 --> 17:26.630
So many hexagonals...

17:26.630 --> 17:28.880
Even court mages won't be able to...

17:31.660 --> 17:32.520
Um...

17:33.230 --> 17:35.120
Will she be okay?

17:35.580 --> 17:37.000
She's unarmed.

17:37.560 --> 17:41.700
Don't worry.
She's as strong as Haruto.

17:41.700 --> 17:43.320
As strong as him?

17:43.320 --> 17:45.370
Enchant Physical Ability.

18:02.050 --> 18:03.150
Give me that.

18:03.150 --> 18:04.390
Um...

18:04.820 --> 18:06.330
Give me your weapon.

18:06.330 --> 18:08.920
Chloe, lend her your spear!

18:08.920 --> 18:10.150
Oh, okay!

18:10.640 --> 18:11.520
Here.

18:11.930 --> 18:13.070
Thanks.

18:13.480 --> 18:15.260
I'll take care of the rest.

18:26.550 --> 18:29.800
Whoa... She really is
as strong as Master Haruto.

18:30.380 --> 18:33.680
Who are these people?

18:38.950 --> 18:40.570
Will she be okay?

18:42.730 --> 18:44.040
Let's have faith in her.

18:51.880 --> 18:52.860
Oh?

18:53.620 --> 18:55.360
That girl...

18:55.790 --> 18:57.370
From back then!

19:00.200 --> 19:03.740
Hey! Don't kill that girl!

19:04.410 --> 19:06.980
I'll finish her off myself.

19:06.980 --> 19:08.920
It just spoke?!

19:09.660 --> 19:10.920
Go.

19:17.680 --> 19:19.900
Forget it! I'll do it myself!

19:19.900 --> 19:22.720
You lot take care of that woman!

19:43.730 --> 19:45.210
Earth Prison!

20:04.500 --> 20:06.010
Now...

20:06.010 --> 20:07.640
You...

20:07.640 --> 20:09.600
...are done for!

20:11.110 --> 20:13.300
Die!

20:27.580 --> 20:29.040
Lady Aishia!

20:36.040 --> 20:38.070
Impossible...

20:55.480 --> 20:56.580
You're in my way.

21:02.910 --> 21:06.900
You bastard!

21:10.200 --> 21:11.450
That voice...

21:11.450 --> 21:12.630
There's no mistaking it.

21:13.240 --> 21:14.370
Lucius...

21:14.860 --> 21:16.630
I've been looking for him.

21:17.200 --> 21:18.150
Where is he?

21:18.530 --> 21:22.420
The residue from the disturbance caused
by physical enhancing magic should remain.

21:25.440 --> 21:26.660
Found him.

21:50.430 --> 21:54.620
I can't believe
someone actually caught up.

21:54.620 --> 21:55.690
So...

21:56.300 --> 21:57.940
Who might you be?

22:06.010 --> 22:10.020
THE FATED NEMESIS

23:39.980 --> 23:40.930
NEXT EPISODE: CHARGE

23:40.930 --> 23:42.130
NEXT EPISODE: CHARGE
Charge.

23:42.130 --> 23:44.990
NEXT EPISODE: CHARGE

23:44.990 --> 23:46.640
SEIREI GENSOUKI - SPIRIT CHRONICLES SEASON 2

23:46.640 --> 23:48.550
ILLUSTRATED BY: FUTAGO MINAZUKI

23:48.550 --> 23:50.940
MASTER HIROAKI!
